,</span><!--]--></span><span class="hero-scene__line--row is-shown hero-scene__line"><!--[--><span class="">      </span><span class="k">&quot;link&quot;</span><span class="">:</span><span class=""> </span><span class="s">&quot;https://www.google.com/search?sca_esv=c2f28d3b49117e12&amp;hl=en&amp;gl=us&amp;q=OpenRouter+founder&amp;sa=X&amp;ved=2ahUKEwj43PP24PuWAxVfrokEHY3OCJsQ1QJ6BAhEEAE&quot;</span><span class="">,</span><!--]--></span><span class="hero-scene__line--row is-shown hero-scene__line"><!--[--><span class="">      </span><span class="k">&quot;block_position&quot;</span><span class="">:</span><span class=""> </span><span class="n">1</span><!--]--></span><span class="hero-scene__line--row is-shown hero-scene__line"><!--[--><span class="">    },</span><!--]--></span><span class="hero-scene__line--row is-shown hero-scene__line"><!--[--><span class="">    ...</span><!--]--></span><span class="hero-scene__line--row is-shown hero-scene__line"><!--[--><span class="">  ],</span><!--]--></span><span class="hero-scene__line--row is-shown hero-scene__line"><!--[--><span class="">  </span><span class="k">&quot;perspectives&quot;</span><span class="">:</span><span class=""> [</span><!--]--></span><span class="hero-scene__line--row is-shown hero-scene__line"><!--[--><span class="">    {</span><!--]--></span><span class="hero-scene__line--row is-shown hero-scene__line"><!--[--><span class="">      </span><span class="k">&quot;title&quot;</span><span class="">:</span><span class=""> </span><span class="s">&quot;Stripe&#39;s acquisition of OpenRouter highlights how quickly the AI market is evolving. While the companies didn&#39;t disclose the purchase price, multiple reports estimate the deal at more than $8 billion, making it Stripe&#39;s largest acquisition to date. OpenRouter does&quot;</span><span class="">,</span><!--]--></span><span class="hero-scene__line--row is-shown hero-scene__line"><!--[--><span class="">      </span><span class="k">&quot;link&quot;</span><span class="">:</span><span class=""> </span><span class="s">&quot;https://www.google.com/goto?url=CAEStAEB6zswFUtjnU80RVzHcarjy7UjprhvW8-nm4uNAAVkE08RqOTTGffOwOFDqVrrLhwndFcYQqbcYVxg_JVMH3QXrsV3C8WPIwO9-ddnWH_aCGOxY7w4qRS0VMFZsOMozkPT-sygFeycy0KyEQex-C9A2aack0tKWgoMJ-KNY6-ZIey_WtzO2mhD8sqO98MyBzOMtcDhJ4Qo9fQVUcD2r1_6M4eJT0BhT3p4OcqfhafeGVGzNE4&quot;</span><span class="">,</span><!--]--></span><span class="hero-scene__line--row is-shown hero-scene__line"><!--[--><span class="">      </span><span class="k">&quot;author&quot;</span><span class="">:</span><span class=""> </span><span class="s">&quot;Maryam A Hassani · LinkedIn&quot;</span><span class="">,</span><!--]--></span><span class="hero-scene__line--row is-shown hero-scene__line"><!--[--><span class="">      </span><span class="k">&quot;author_description&quot;</span><span class="">:</span><span class=""> </span><span class="s">&quot;AI &amp; tech startup co-founder&quot;</span><span class="">,</span><!--]--></span><span class="hero-scene__line--row is-shown hero-scene__line"><!--[--><span class="">      </span><span class="k">&quot;date&quot;</span><span class="">:</span><span class=""> </span><span class="s">&quot;2 weeks ago&quot;</span><span class="">,</span><!--]--></span><span class="hero-scene__line--row is-shown hero-scene__line"><!--[--><span class="">      </span><span class="k">&quot;thumbnails&quot;</span><span class="">:</span><span class=""> [</span><!--]--></span><span class="hero-scene__line--row is-shown hero-scene__line"><!--[--><span class="">        </span><span class="s">&quot;https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcSYqgaqDRWnACt_KTH3X8N9j835EUzcl6fw15-_M-3ElA-6kYQNTHajmGuYSw&amp;usqp=CAI&amp;s&quot;</span><!--]--></span><span class="hero-scene__line--row is-shown hero-scene__line"><!--[--><span class="">      ]</span><!--]--></span><span class="hero-scene__line--row is-shown hero-scene__line"><!--[--><span class="">    },</span><!--]--></span><span class="hero-scene__line--row is-shown hero-scene__line"><!--[--><span class="">    {</span><!--]--></span><span class="hero-scene__line--row is-shown hero-scene__line"><!--[--><span class="">      </span><span class="k">&quot;title&quot;</span><span class="">:</span><span class=""> </span><span class="s">&quot;I can now officially say it: OpenRouter is being acquired by Stripe! Although we cannot comment on the price, this marks one of the fastest acquisitions of this scale in history: almost exactly 3 years after founding. In this blog post, we write about the founding story and history of OpenRouter, why we invested and why Stripe is the perfect acquirer. A few of the highlights: People love to say \&quot;OpenRouter has no moat\&quot;. They think of moats primarily as technical difficulty. As a two-sided model marketplace, OpenRouter provides a really valuable service to model labs: predictability in capacity and distribution. And to user: a simple way to access all models. With scale, OpenRouter is able to provide better uptime, more models, with the cheapest discounts and have model labs prioritize launching on OR first! — We saw this with Zuck and Elon both tweeting about their models on OR first, all Chinese models announcing on OR and OpenAI doing their secret model launches on OR and having&quot;</span><span class="">,</span><!--]--></span><span class="hero-scene__line--row is-shown hero-scene__line"><!--[--><span class="">      </span><span class="k">&quot;link&quot;</span><span class="">:</span><span class=""> </span><span class="s">&quot;https://www.google.com/goto?url=CAESnwEB6zswFXqc6tdJ5VhWwRzumwG7h45tTl-2xEyjgPtd8gErYPMYovNzTXxRFIaaIKUu_O_7htVE49F0BfsNd2kcOUP3k0RMHM0V9QjpqiTjlApxA6DKNJZwmvqIEIdJjBuUCrE8ZNTImtIjgqSUXiv0t0BrxBY9iMLca4BtgOA_Qts6N6IVVbxbnsDxsG3rv7Y1RwbodjYfaNOO6c2nO3U&quot;</span><span class="">,</span><!--]--></span><span class="hero-scene__line--row is-shown hero-scene__line"><!--[--><span class="">      </span><span class="k">&quot;author&quot;</span><span class="">:</span><span class=""> </span><span class="s">&quot;deedydas · X&quot;</span><span class="">,</span><!--]--></span><span class="hero-scene__line--row is-shown hero-scene__line"><!--[--><span class="">      </span><span class="k">&quot;author_description&quot;</span><span class="">:</span><span class=""> </span><span class="s">&quot;Investor in Anthropic&quot;</span><span class="">,</span><!--]--></span><span class="hero-scene__line--row is-shown hero-scene__line"><!--[--><span class="">      </span><span class="k">&quot;date&quot;</span><span class="">:</span><span class=""> </span><span class="s">&quot;1 month ago&quot;</span><span class="">,</span><!--]--></span><span class="hero-scene__line--row is-shown hero-scene__line"><!--[--><span class="">      </span><span class="k">&quot;extensions&quot;</span><span class="">:</span><span class=""> [</span><!--]--></span><span class="hero-scene__line--row is-shown hero-scene__line"><!--[--><span class="">        </span><span class="s">&quot;1.7K+ likes&quot;</span><!--]--></span><span class="hero-scene__line--row is-shown hero-scene__line"><!--[--><span class="">      ]</span><!--]--></span><span class="hero-scene__line--row is-shown hero-scene__line"><!--[--><span class="">    },</span><!--]--></span><span class="hero-scene__line--row is-shown hero-scene__line"><!--[--><span class="">    ...</span><!--]--></span><span class="hero-scene__line--row is-shown hero-scene__line"><!--[--><span class="">  ],</span><!--]--></span><span class="hero-scene__line--row is-shown hero-scene__line"><!--[--><span class="">  </span><span class="k">&quot;search_information&quot;</span><span class="">:</span><span class=""> {</span><!--]--></span><span class="hero-scene__line--row is-shown hero-scene__line"><!--[--><span class="">    </span><span class="k">&quot;total_results&quot;</span><span class="">:</span><span class=""> </span><span class="n">121</span><span class="">,</span><!--]--></span><span class="hero-scene__line--row is-shown he